  "copulas": "ke = is (temporary state or location now); ka = is (permanent quality or identity). A predicate adjective may also stand bare: lira benasan.",
  "questions": "Keep statement order and put ki at the end of the clause. Question words are ki- correlatives (ki-coda what, ki-nela who, ki-pago where, ki-krono when, ki-kasa why, ki-modo how) and stay in place.",
